#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:83 imageeffect_blowup.cpp:102
#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:129
msgid "Blowup Photograph"
msgstr "Foto en Explosión"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:87
msgid "&Save As..."
msgstr "&Guardar Como..."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:88
msgid "&Load..."
msgstr "&Carregar..."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:92
msgid "<p>Reset all filter parameters to their default values."
msgstr "<p>Reiniciar todos os parámetros do filtro aos seus valores predefinidos."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:93
msgid "<p>Load all filter parameters from settings text file."
msgstr "<p>Carregar todos os parámetros do filtro a partir do ficheiro de configurazón."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:94
msgid "<p>Save all filter parameters to settings text file."
msgstr "<p>Guardar todos os parámetros do filtro nun ficheiro de configurazón."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:104
msgid "A digiKam image plugin to blowup a photograph."
msgstr "Un plugin de digiKam para \"explodir\" unha fotografia."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:110
msgid "Author and maintainer"
msgstr "Autoria e mantimento"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:113
msgid "CImg library"
msgstr "Biblioteca CImg"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:116
msgid "Feedback and plugin polishing"
msgstr "Reaczóns e polimento do plugin"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:122
msgid "Plugin Handbook"
msgstr "Manual do plugin"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:139
msgid "New Size"
msgstr "Novo Tamaño"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:147
msgid "Visit CImg library website"
msgstr "Páxina Web da biblioteca CImg"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:149
msgid "Width:"
msgstr "Largura:"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:153
msgid "<p>Set here the new imager width in pixels."
msgstr "<p>Defina aqui a nova largura da imaxe en pixels."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:155
msgid "Height:"
msgstr "Altura:"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:159
msgid "<p>Set here the new image height in pixels."
msgstr "<p>Defina aqui a nova altura da imaxe en pixels."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:161
msgid "Maintain aspect ratio"
msgstr "Manter as proporzóns de tamaño"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:162
msgid "<p>Enable this option to maintain aspect ratio with new image sizes."
msgstr ""
"<p>Active esta opzón para manter as proporzóns de tamaño da imaxe coas "
"novas dimensións."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:173
msgid "<p>This is the current percentage of the task completed."
msgstr "<p>Esta é a porcentaxe da tarefa actualmente completa ."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:180
msgid "Smoothing"
msgstr "Suavizazón"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:182
msgid "Detail preservation:"
msgstr "Preservazón dos detalles:"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:187
msgid ""
"<p>Preservation of details to set the sharpening level of the small features "
"in the target image. Higher values leave details sharp."
msgstr ""
"<p>A preservazón dos detalles para definir o nível de afiamento dos pequenos "
"detalles na imaxe obxectivo. Os valores mais altos deixan os detalles ben "
"definidos."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:193
msgid "Anisotropy:"
msgstr "Anisotropia:"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:198
msgid ""
"<p>Anisotropic (directional) modifier of the details. Keep it small for "
"Gaussian noise."
msgstr ""
"<p>Modificador anisotrópico (direccional) dos detalles. Deixe-o baixo para "
"obter un ruído Gausiano."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:202
msgid "Smoothing:"
msgstr "Suavizazón:"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:207
msgid ""
"<p>Total smoothing power: if Detail Factor sets the relative smoothing and "
"Gradient Factor the direction, Time Step sets the overall effect."
msgstr ""
"<p>Poténcia de suavizazón total: se o Factor de Detalle define a suavizazón "
"relativa e o Factor Gradiente a direczón, o Paso Temporal define o efeito "
"global."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:212
msgid "Regularity:"
msgstr "Regularidade:"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:217
msgid ""
"<p>This value controls the smoothing regularity of the target image. Do not "
"use an high value here, else the target image will be completely blurred."
msgstr ""
"<p>Este valor controla a regularidade de suavizazón da imaxe final. Non use un "
"valor alto aqui, ou a imaxe final quedará completamente borrada."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:223
msgid "Iterations:"
msgstr "Iterazóns:"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:228
msgid "<p>Sets the number of times the filter is applied on the target image."
msgstr "<p>Define o número de veces que o filtro é aplicado na imaxe final."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:236
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Configurazón Avanzada"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:238
msgid "Angular step:"
msgstr "Paso angular:"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:243
msgid "<p>Set here the angular integration step in degrees in analogy to anisotropy."
msgstr ""
"<p>Defina aqui o paso de integrazón angular en graus, en analoxia coa "
"anisotropia."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:247
msgid "Integral step:"
msgstr "Paso integral:"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:252
msgid "<p>Set here the spatial integral step. Stay below 1."
msgstr "<p>Defina aqui o paso integral espacial. Defina-o como menor que 1."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:256
msgid "Gaussian:"
msgstr "Gausiano:"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:261
msgid "<p>Set here the precision of the Gaussian function."
msgstr "<p>Defina aqui a precisión da funzón gausiana."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:265
msgid "Use linear interpolation"
msgstr "Usar a interpolazón linear"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:266
msgid "<p>Enable this option to quench the last bit of quality (slow)."
msgstr "<p>Active esta opzón para aproveitar o último ponto de calidade (lento)."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:269
msgid "Normalize photograph"
msgstr "Normalizar a fotografia"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:270
msgid "<p>Enable this option to process an output image normalization."
msgstr "<p>Active esta opzón para facer unha normalizazón na imaxe final."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:462
msgid "BlowUp"
msgstr "Explosión"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:487
msgid "Photograph Blowup Settings File to Load"
msgstr "Carregando o Arquivo de Configurazón da Explosión da Fotografia"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:499
msgid "\"%1\" is not a Photograph Blowup settings text file."
msgstr "\"%1\" non é un ficheiro de configurazón da explosión da fotografia."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:520
msgid "Cannot load settings from the Photograph Blowup text file."
msgstr ""
"Non foi posíbel carregar a configurazón desde o  ficheiro de explosión da "
"fotografia."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:529
msgid "Photograph Blowup Settings File to Save"
msgstr "Guardando o Arquivo de Configurazón da Explosión da Fotografia"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:551
msgid "Cannot save settings to the Photograph Blowup text file."
msgstr ""
"Non foi posíbel guardar a configurazón do ficheiro de texto de explosión da "
"fotografia."

#: imageplugin_blowup.cpp:42
msgid "Blowup..."
msgstr "Explosión..."

